{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-o031b","title":"甄德承甄氏姓为平原侯袭公主爵","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-o031b-account","label":"《后妃传》正文","text":"甄德承甄氏姓为平原侯袭公主爵","evidence":["houfei-e-o031b-q"]},{"id":"houfei-a-p016-judgment","label":"孙盛论","text":"孙盛认为异族德继甄氏并袭公主爵违情背典，陈群杨阜之谏尚未极陈礼义。","evidence":["houfei-q-p016-judgment"]},{"id":"houfei-a-o050-adoption","label":null,"text":"郭元后家族叙事另记建兄德出养甄氏，作为出继的同篇补证。","evidence":["houfei-q-o050-adoption"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houfei-p0042","role":"出继受封","evidence":["houfei-e-o031b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":232,"label":"太和六年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"houfei-y232","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"houfei-q-o031","basis":"太和六年"},"evidence":["houfei-e-o031b-q","houfei-q-o031","mingdi-q-o026","mingdi-q-b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-o031b-q","source_order":[5,125,"O031b"],"order":1408}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0042","name":"甄德","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-o031b-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6812c920b6ae5772de59","layer":"original","quote":"太和六年，明帝爱女淑薨，追封谥淑为平原懿公主，为之立庙。取后亡从孙黄与合葬〖22〗，追封黄列侯。以夫人郭氏从弟德，为之后〖23〗，承甄氏姓；封德为平原侯，袭公主爵。﹝一﹞","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85},{"id":"houfei-q-o031","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6812c920b6ae5772de59","layer":"original","quote":"太和六年，明帝爱女淑薨，追封谥淑为平原懿公主，为之立庙。取后亡从孙黄与合葬〖22〗，追封黄列侯。以夫人郭氏从弟德，为之后〖23〗，承甄氏姓；封德为平原侯，袭公主爵。﹝一﹞","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":124,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85},{"id":"houfei-q-o050-adoption","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-6dc749ac781a81d5a82f","layer":"original","quote":"建兄德，出养甄氏。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":236,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":92,"end":101},{"id":"houfei-q-p016-judgment","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-142f6089b490c1194a14","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞孙盛曰：“于礼：妇人既无封爵之典；况于孩末，而可建以大邑乎？德自异族，援继非类；匪功匪亲，而袭母爵：违情背典，于此为甚！陈群虽抗言，杨阜引事比并；然皆不能极陈先王之礼，明封建继嗣之义；忠至之辞，犹有阙乎！《诗》云：‘赫赫师尹，民具尔瞻。’宰辅之职，其可略哉！”","attribution":"孙盛论","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-9de40166c48022ac7ce3","start":0,"end":133},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-412fc25655f53a4b4d33","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：太和六年（公元 232）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-d1427f90b1f8dd585e5a","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"mingdi-q-o026","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-42d0ed5edde34d9ea9f5","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，诏曰：“古之帝王，封建诸侯，所以藩屏王室也〖2〗。《诗》不云乎，‘怀德维宁，宗子维城’〖3〗。秦、汉继周，或强或弱〖4〗，俱失厥中〖5〗。大魏创业，诸王开国；随时之宜，未有定制：非所以永为后法也。其改封诸侯王，皆以郡为国〖6〗。”三月，癸酉〖7〗，行东巡；所过存问高年鳏寡孤独〖8〗，赐谷帛。乙亥〖9〗，月犯轩辕大星。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":186,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
